      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would also not get your hopes up about \"limitations\" as the PS4 VR is running on quite old hardware and most people's avatars in vrchat have stats of that equal to an entire game. Maybe in the future of playstation consoles these limitations maybe less or lifted. They would also though have to abide by the TOS of Sony as Sony will want to limit the kind of content people are seeing which VRChat are currently being overwhelmed with. Aside from that though I do know Ron does want VRChat to reach as many platforms as possible really including Tablets and maybe phones as mentioned before in the past.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
